text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures able to block target creature this turn do so.', "Armored Galleon can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Bee Sting deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nCreatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nDestroy target attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to you this turn by attacking creatures.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nReturn target attacking creature to its owner's hand.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nUntap all creatures you control.", 'Counter target creature or sorcery spell.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target sorcery spell.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during their next untap step.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Dakmor Plague deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.', "Dakmor Sorceress's power is equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying", 'Destroy all creatures target opponent controls. You lose 2 life for each creature destroyed this way.', 'Destroy all lands.', 'Destroy all tapped creatures. You gain 2 life for each creature destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. You gain 3 life.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Draw a card for each tapped creature target opponent controls.', 'Draw four cards, then discard three cards at random.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', 'Flying', "Flying\nGoblin Glider can't block.", "Flying\nWhen Angel of Fury dies, you may shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Flying\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Foul Spirit enters the battlefield, sacrifice a land.', 'Flying\nWhen Screeching Drake enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.', "Flying\nWhen Sea Drake enters the battlefield, return two target lands you control to their owner's hand.", "Flying\nWhen Talas Explorer enters the battlefield, look at target opponent's hand.", 'Flying\nWhen Vampiric Spirit enters the battlefield, you lose 4 life.', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Goblin War Strike deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to the number of Goblins you control.', 'Haste', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', 'If Cunning Giant is unblocked, you may have it assign its combat damage to a creature defending player controls.', "Ironhoof Ox can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to each of two target creatures.', 'Kiss of Death deals 4 damage to target opponent or planeswalker. You gain 4 life.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Look at the top card of target player's library. You may put that card into their graveyard.", 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Nightstalker Engine's power is equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.", "Norwood Riders can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", 'One or two target creatures gain flying until end of turn.', "Prowling Nightstalker can't be blocked except by black creatures.", 'Put target card from your graveyard on top of your library.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Return all Nightstalker permanent cards from your graveyard to the battlefield. Then destroy all Swamps you control.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return two target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Sacrifice Goblin Firestarter: It deals 1 damage to any target. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', 'Search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Shuffle any number of target creature cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Steam Frigate can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Swarm of Rats's power is equal to the number of Rats you control.", "Sylvan Yeti's power is equal to the number of cards in your hand.", 'Take an extra turn after this one.', "Talas Warrior can't be blocked.", 'Tap any number of untapped creatures you control. You gain 4 life for each creature tapped this way.', 'Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', "Target opponent chooses a creature they control. Other creatures they control can't block this turn.", 'Target opponent draws a card.\nYou gain 7 life.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', "Until end of turn, you may tap lands you don't control for mana. Spend this mana only to cast spells.", 'Vigilance', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Alaborn Zealot blocks a creature, destroy that creature and Alaborn Zealot.', 'When Brutal Nightstalker enters the battlefield, you may have target opponent discard a card.', "When Denizen of the Deep enters the battlefield, return each other creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'When Goblin Matron enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Goblin card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Hidden Horror enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a creature card.', 'When Magma Giant enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.', 'When Ogre Arsonist enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', 'When Predatory Nightstalker enters the battlefield, you may have target opponent sacrifice a creature.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Temple Acolyte enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', "Whenever Abyssal Nightstalker attacks and isn't blocked, defending player discards a card.", 'Whenever Alaborn Cavalier attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever Goblin General attacks, Goblin creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Lurking Nightstalker attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Norwood Warrior becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Razorclaw Bear becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Sylvan Basilisk becomes blocked by a creature, destroy that creature.', 'Whenever Town Sentry blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain 2 life for each creature you control.', "You may have Deathcoil Wurm assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Lone Wolf assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", '{T}: Apprentice Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', "{T}: Return Coastal Wizard and another target creature to their owners' hands. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.", '{T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: You gain 1 life. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: You may put a green creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.']
